### Smart Savor API — click "Send Request" above each block.
### Needs the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client). App must be running
### (npm run dev, http://localhost:3000). Blocks 3–6 auto-chain off #2.

@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1 · Health
GET {{base}}/health

### 2 · Caseload (list patients) — copy an id, or let #3+ auto-use the first
# @name patients
GET {{base}}/patients

### 3 · Patient snapshot
@sam = {{patients.response.body.$[0].id}}
GET {{base}}/patients/{{sam}}

### 4 · Ranked focus set (Dietitian D1.5)
GET {{base}}/patients/{{sam}}/focus-set

### 5 · Ratified iron menu (Dietitian D2/D3)
# @name ironMenu
GET {{base}}/patients/{{sam}}/approved-lists/iron

### 6 · THE USP — choose a food → recomputed amount (expect "~1½ cups of lentils")
@item = {{ironMenu.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
POST {{base}}/patients/{{sam}}/choices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvedListItemId": "{{item}}"
}
